        <body>
            <div xml:id="d70">

                <pb facs="0285" n="254" sameAs="frus:frus1969-76v31/pg254"/>

                <head>70. Memorandum by the Under Secretary of the Treasury for Monetary Affairs
                        (Bennett)<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d70-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1974-08-05">August 5, 1974</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list type="to">
                    <head>MEMORANDUM FOR</head>
                    <item>The Honorable Henry Kissinger
                    </item>
                    <item>Secretary of State</item>
                    <item>The Honorable Arthur Burns
                    </item>
                    <item>Chairman, Federal Reserve Board</item>
                    <item>The Honorable Kenneth Rush
                    </item>
                    <item>Counsellor to the President</item>
                    <item>The Honorable Herbert Stein
                    </item>
                    <item>Chairman, Council of Economic Advisers</item>
                </list>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Gold</item>
                </list>
                <p>Secretary Simon asked that I forward the
                    attached to you with the request that you consider concurring in his forwarding
                    the attached draft memorandum to the President.</p>
                <p>In view of the sensitive nature of the proposal I hope that it will be possible
                    to limit distribution of the document within your group. Attached are:<anchor
                        n="2" xml:id="d70-f2"/>
                </p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>A draft memorandum to the President;</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>A memorandum discussing procedures for a proposed auction, <pb facs="0286"
                            n="255" xml:id="pg255"/> together with a draft General Services
                        Administration announcement of such an auction;</item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>A draft Treasury press release announcing the removal of gold ownership
                        restraints and a planned auction of gold;</item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>A draft Executive Order to terminate the gold ownership restraints;
                        and</item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>A draft letter from the President to the Congress, notifying the Congress,
                        in accordance with legislative requirements, that the removal of restraints
                        on gold ownership will not adversely affect the international monetary
                        position of the United States.</item>
                </list>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#bold">Jack F. Bennett</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d70-a1.xml" xpointer="d70-a1"/>
